ays a checkbox labeled 'Are you legally eligible to work in the United Stat=
es?'  Below this, the label 'Type' precedes a text input field displaying '=
Yes/No,' indicating a yes/no question type.  Further down, the label 'Quest=
ion' is followed by a larger text box containing the same question: 'Are yo=
