asizing the competitiveness of the process.  The entire diagram uses trapez=
oids to represent the stages and rhombi to provide descriptions of each sta=
ge, illustrating the decreasing number of candidates at each step of the hi=
ring process." loading=3D"lazy" width=3D"669" height=3D"539" decoding=3D"as=
