how the first mobile engineer at Uber was hired</strong></p><p>Jordan Bonne=
t was the first mobile engineer hired at Uber and employee #5. He shares th=
e surprising story of him getting this job=E2=80=94and an example of how ap=
plying to small companies can pay off.</p><p><em>=E2=80=9CI had been workin=
g as a software engineer for two years in France, and I wanted to get a job=
