y Hired, and applied for more than 20 jobs. I heard back from 3 companies: =
Qik, Eventbrite, and UberCab. Qik told me hiring from abroad was complicate=
d for them at the time. Eventbrite told me they don=E2=80=99t sponsor visas=
.</em></p><p><em>UberCab just asked if I wanted to do the coding challenge,=
 which I did. I then had an interview with the first engineer at the compan=
y and the CEO, and that was it. They extended an offer and sponsored my vis=
a.</em></p><p><em><strong>Applying to very small companies can be a great m=
ove</strong> because they often have a very lightweight recruitment process=
 and can move really fast. A couple of months into joining, I asked why the=
